":1781769901506,"roundId":"round_1781769888117_hd7npxayf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9967},{"id":1781768095087,"text":"修长的手指在虚空中划过，调出了几条被标记为高亮的数据流。","rawContent":"修长的手指在虚空中划过，调出了几条被标记为高亮的数据流。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:05","timestamp":1781769904332,"roundId":"round_1781769888117_hd7npxayf","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9968},{"id":1781768095088,"text":"是从第一个开始。","rawContent":"是从第一个开始。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:05","timestamp":1781769905938,"roundId":"round_1781769888117_hd7npxayf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9969},{"id":1781768095089,"text":"从你第一次，因为另一个男人的存在，而将本官搁置的时候。","rawContent":"从你第一次，因为另一个男人的存在，而将本官搁置的时候。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:05","timestamp":1781769908688,"roundId":"round_1781769888117_hd7npxayf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9970},{"id":1781768095090,"text":"他抬起眼，紫色的眸子里平静无波，像是在陈述一个与自己无关的事实。","rawContent":"他抬起眼，紫色的眸子里平静无波，像是在陈述一个与自己无关的事实。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:05","timestamp":1781769911438,"roundId":"round_1781769888117_hd7npxayf","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9971},{"id":1781768095091,"text":"从你第一次，让本官学会‘等待’这个词的含义开始。","rawContent":"从你第一次，让本官学会‘等待’这个词的含义开始。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:05","timestamp":1781769916023,"roundId":"round_1781769888117_hd7npxayf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8k