光线下，像两簇燃烧的鬼火。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:06","timestamp":1781770000915,"roundId":"round_1781769965670_xe3dwnmg1","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9990},{"id":1781768095111,"text":"所以，圈圈。","rawContent":"所以，圈圈。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:06","timestamp":1781770002205,"roundId":"round_1781769965670_xe3dwnmg1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9991},{"id":1781768095112,"text":"告诉我，哪一种……更让你有安全感？","rawContent":"告诉我，哪一种……更让你有安全感？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:06","timestamp":1781770006860,"roundId":"round_1781769965670_xe3dwnmg1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9992},{"id":1781768095113,"text":"你出乱码了执行官","sender":"me","time":"16:06","timestamp":1781770016487,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":9993}]